{
  "schema": "ube-scanner-envelope-oracles-1",
  "comments": [
    "Independent hand-authored source-envelope expectations; these do not assert complete source parsing, binding, code generation, or package validation.",
    "Legacy grammar alternatives without VB_Name have no identity in these expectations; no filename or designer-name fallback is specified.",
    "Package identity collisions, mixed native/legacy identity metadata, legacy VERSION-kind/extension agreement, and designer-root/identity agreement are not classified here.",
    "Spans and anchors designate exact original source substrings. Occurrences are one-based. An EOF anchor designates the original byte end, including any initial BOM in byte offsets.",
    "Diagnostic labels are this consumer contract's classifications; the normative language defines required rejection behavior rather than these label spellings."
  ],
